{
  "_comment": "Shared TASKS.md §3.8 key-notation fixture. The `src/keys.rs` unit tests and `tests/test_keymap.lua` both consume this file, so the Rust and Lua translators are pinned to the same cases. `roundTrip` lists canonical chords that must parse and re-format identically; `toNeovim` and `toVscode` are [canonical, translated] pairs; `invalidCanonical` and `invalidNeovim` must be rejected.",
  "roundTrip": [
    "s",
    "S",
    "?",
    "%",
    "$",
    "!",
    "-",
    "=",
    "Enter",
    "Escape",
    "Tab",
    "shift+Tab",
    "Delete",
